cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Command Scale"
abstract: >-
  A six-level scale of what a person can get an artificial intelligence to
  produce, read from that person's own words and counted rather than judged.
  This repository holds the normative text, the four standards a reading is
  taken against, the instrument that takes one on a person's own machine, and
  the conformance cases an implementation is put through.
